Everyone!
The reason why I asked all of you to come is the stolen necklace.

scripts.translation:
{0}
各位！
我请大家来，是为了调查项链失窃的事。

scripts.text:
{0}
I'll think about it more
and continue my explanations again.

{0}
Who is the Thief?
This is complicated.

scripts.translation:
{0}
小偷是谁？
这件事有点复杂。

scripts.text:
{0}
First... Let me reveal
the thief straight up!!

{0}
The thief who stole 
the necklace is!!

{0}
The robber is none other than
^006400Rosa^000000!!

{0}
The robber is none other than
the ^006400Wandering Merchant^000000!!

{0}
The robber is none other than
^006400Dames^000000!!

{0}
The robber is none other than
^006400Balumin^000000!!

{0}
The robber is none other than
^006400Cruyan^000000!!

scripts.translation:
{0}
让我再仔细想想...
想好后再继续说明。

scripts.text:
{0}
{1}
I... I guess
I must have gotten something wrong.
I'll think about it more and figure out who the robber is...

scripts.translation:
{0}
{1}
我...我想是哪里弄错了。
我会再想想，找出真正的小偷...

scripts.text:
{0}
Rosa is the thief for sure!!
The reason for the robbery is that~!!

scripts.translation:
{0}
小偷肯定是罗莎！！
至于作案动机嘛~！！

scripts.text:
{0}
According to Luen she thought she was the first one to arrive at home.
But she found out that Rosa had arrived before her and still left me lying there unconscious.

scripts.translation:
{0}
综合这些线索！罗莎！
你说自己完全信任家人，足以看出你爱护他们。

scripts.text:
{0}
By making it seem like the necklace, you got from Dames, was stolen you tried to bring the family closer and bring more attention to yourself.
Now~ would you show everyone the necklace and confess?

scripts.translation:
{0}
你故意让达姆斯送你的项链看起来像是被偷了，想借此拉近家人的关系，也让大家多关心你。
好了~把项链拿出来，承认吧？

{0}
流浪商人肯定是小偷！！
理由如下~！！

scripts.text:
{0}
This kind of robbery is rare in this neighborhood.
In other words, it's very likely that a stranger to this area would be responsible.

{0}
More importantly, smell of alcohol wreaks from you right now!!
Among the stolen items were two bottles of alcohol as well!

scripts.translation:
{0}
更重要的是，你现在满身酒味！！
失窃物里也有两瓶酒！

{0}
综合所有线索！流浪商人！
你的生意不好，所以才闯进屋里偷东西。

{0}
你还拿走两瓶酒喝了！！
现在~把项链拿出来认罪吧？

scripts.text:
{0}
Dames is definitely the one!!
The reason being~!!

scripts.translation:
{0}
小偷肯定是达姆斯！！
理由如下~！！

scripts.text:
{0}
Now~ would you show everyone
the necklace and confess?

scripts.translation:
{0}
巴卢明肯定是小偷！！
理由如下~！！

{0}
他说自己见过达姆斯，而且达姆斯最近手头拮据。
我还听说你私下向他借过钱。

{0}
但我知道达姆斯没借钱给你。
你一定因此很失望、很生气。

scripts.text:
{0}
Now~ would you show everyone
the necklace and confess?

{0}
Cruyan is definitely the robber!
The reason being~!!

scripts.translation:
{0}
克鲁扬就是窃贼！
理由是~！！

{0}
你刚才也看到了，罗莎经常冲克鲁扬大吼大叫。
遭受这种对待，难免会心生怨恨。

{0}
他并没有就此收手。
他还偷了两瓶酒。

{0}
罗莎反对他和露恩交往，主要是因为他嗜赌又爱喝酒。
他一定是一时冲动才犯下罪行！！

{0}
罗莎从一开始就不喜欢嗜赌又爱喝酒的克鲁扬。
他想方设法改变自己，可是...

scripts.text:
{0}
it's never easy to change anyone's first impression.
Thus, he stole the necklace first and wanted to earn Rosa's trust by acting like he found it again.

scripts.translation:
{0}
要改变一个人对自己的第一印象并不容易。
所以他先偷走项链，再假装重新找回项链，想借此赢得罗莎的信任。

scripts.text:
{0}
Furthermore, the Concentration Potion you gave me as a proof of your alibi is not something you can obtain in the land of the blooming flowers.
It was confirmed that you can get it from the Wandering Merchant.

scripts.translation:
{0}
而且，你拿来证明自己不在场的集中药水，并不是繁花之地能取得的东西。
我们已经查明，那是从流浪商人那里买来的。

scripts.text:
{0}
No... No way?
Did I make a mistake?

scripts.translation:
{0}
不...怎么会？
难道是我弄错了？

scripts.text:
{0}
There's no way!
Let's think about it again.

scripts.translation:
{0}
不可能！
我们再重新理一理线索。

{0}
她或许理解你的心情，却并不赞同你的做法。
她上前阻止你偷项链，拉扯之间，项链就不见了...

{0}
就在那时，我从外面进了屋。
你怕事情败露，便把我打晕了...

{0}
克鲁扬，你一进屋就说项链被偷了。
明明没人告诉过你，你又是怎么知道的？

scripts.text:
{0}
Strangely chaotic furnitures,
Poppy who didn't bark at the robber, and Luen and Cruyan who made up an ill-prepared story at the shock of it all, and if you follow these leads...

scripts.translation:
{0}
我...我想我一定是弄错了。
我会再仔细想想，找出真正的窃贼...
